    },
    {
      "recording_id": "8455-210777-0027",
      "duration_seconds": 12.625,
      "word_count": 39,
      "reference_text": "WHEN THIS CAPTAIN SHOULD HAVE TAKEN HIMSELF AND HIS VESSEL BACK TO ENGLAND I WOULD RETIRE TO A SMALL FARM WHICH I POSSESSED AT THE FARTHEST SIDE OF THE ISLAND AND THERE IN SECLUSION WOULD I END MY DAYS",
